abstract: >
  Unified experimental research artifact for the Latent Behavioral Structure
  in Low-Dimensional Statistical Manifolds of Adaptive, Autonomous, Sequential
  Systems (LBSM) research program, containing the experimental report,
  research notebooks, source code, experimental outputs, figures, and
  reproducibility materials corresponding to Notebooks 01–07.

